sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant BFF as storefront-bff
  participant KC as Keycloak
  participant C as customer
  participant L as location
  participant O as order
  participant P as payment
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant K as Kafka

  U->>BFF: login
  BFF->>KC: auth
  U->>BFF: save address
  BFF->>C: address APIs
  C->>L: create/get address
  L->>DB: address PII
  C->>DB: user_address link
  U->>BFF: checkout
  BFF->>O: create order
  O->>C: get profile
  O->>DB: email + order_address PII
  BFF->>P: pay
  P->>O: update status
  DB->>K: Debezium order/product CDC
